        "Description": "Four people in Miami have become targets for reasons known only to our client. Steven Atkinson, a burger vendor; Miles Hopson, a civilian; Edward “Ted” Mendez, a U.S. military officer and defense funding consultant; and Jude Black, an event security guard. The client wants all four eliminated. There is one unusual condition: every target must be killed with a cleaver.",
